         "label": "module_1",
         "name": "module_1",
         "params": {
          "align": "left",
          "body_size": 18,
          "content": "<h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 26px\">Combine private labeling with supplement dropshipping for maximum convenience and profitability.</h2><p>Private labeling means selling ready-for-use formulations with your brand and packaging. <a href=\"https://blog.davincilabs.com/private-label/how-to-get-started-with-dropshipping-supplements\" style=\"color: #6ba644; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 400\">Dropshipping</a> means we fulfill every order directly to your customer. Combine the two and you get a low-overhead, high-margin supplement business you can scale quickly.</p><p>Skip product development. Skip inventory storage. Skip the warehouse lease. Add new SKUs without buying equipment or hiring staff. Start small, prove the market, scale fast.</p>",
          "css_class": "dnd-module",
          "heading_size": 32,
          "max_width": 810,
          "module_id": 218940115784,
          "style": {
           "background_color": {
