    },
    {
     "0": {
      "cells": [],
      "cssClass": "",
      "cssId": "",
      "cssStyle": "",
      "name": "column_3",
      "params": {
       "css_class": "dnd-column"
      },
      "rowMetaData": [
       {
        "cssClass": "dnd-row"
       }
      ],
      "rows": [
       {
        "0": {
         "cells": [],
         "cssClass": "",
         "cssId": "",
         "cssStyle": "",
         "label": "module_3",
         "name": "module_3",
         "params": {
          "body_color": {
           "color": "#555555",
           "opacity": 100
          },
          "body_size": 15,
          "card_align": "left",
          "card_density": "standard",
          "card_style": "card",
          "cards": [
           {
            "content": "<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">No bulk inventory orders. No storage location. No inventory management overhead. You pay for product when your customer pays you, not before.</p>",
            "icon": {
             "alt": "",
             "loading": "lazy",
             "src": ""
            },
            "title": "Lower overhead, less capital tied up"
           },
           {
            "content": "<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Our fulfillment is built for speed &mdash; streamlined, scalable, and quick to turn around orders. Customers prioritize delivery speed, and fast turnaround drives repeat sales.</p>",
            "icon": {
             "alt": "",
             "loading": "lazy",
             "src": ""
            },
            "title": "Faster turnaround on every order"
           },
           {
            "content": "<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">With shipping and fulfillment handled, you focus on customer service, content, paid acquisition, and product strategy. The activities that compound, not the ones that consume.</p>",
            "icon": {
             "alt": "",
             "loading": "lazy",
             "src": ""
            },
            "title": "More time for what grows the business"
           },
           {
            "content": "<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Want to test a trendy supplement or a new flavored protein? Add it to your line without a significant upfront investment. Validate demand before committing.</p>",
            "icon": {
             "alt": "",
             "loading": "lazy",
             "src": ""
            },
            "title": "Freedom to experiment"
           },
           {
            "content": "<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">You only pay when customers place orders. No more guessing at demand. No more dead inventory tying up cash.</p>",
            "icon": {
             "alt": "",
             "loading": "lazy",
             "src": ""
            },
            "title": "Reduced risk on every SKU"
           },
           {
            "content": "<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Adding 10 new SKUs in a traditional retail model means more storage, more cash tied up, more SKUs to manage. With dropshipping, it means updating your product page.</p>",
            "icon": {
             "alt": "",
             "loading": "lazy",
             "src": ""
            },
            "title": "Scale without operational drag"
           }
          ],
