          "body_size": 16,
          "content": "<p>From ADK to Zinc, we offer <a href=\"https://www.davincilabs.com/product-guide\" style=\"color: #6BA644; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 400\">190+ doctor-formulated private label supplements</a> ready to brand and ship. FDA-registered facility. GMP certified to SQF and NSF GMP 455-2 standards. Our expert team works with you on custom branding, then handles fulfillment for every order so you can focus on growing the business.</p>",
