         "label": "module_11",
         "name": "module_11",
         "params": {
          "body_size": 18,
          "content": "<p>With over 50 years in the health supplement industry, we are one of the most trusted dietary supplement providers. Every private label supplement we produce is doctor-formulated using thoroughly researched ingredients, then scientifically reviewed for efficacy and quality before it ever enters production in our U.S. facilities.</p><p>FoodScience is an FDA-registered food facility, GMP certified to SQF food safety standards, and certified to NSF GMP 455-2.</p><p>When you partner with us, our expert team is with you every step of the way. Help your customers find what they want from a source they trust. You.</p>",
          "css_class": "dnd-module",
