         "label": "module_12",
         "name": "module_12",
         "params": {
          "answer_size": 15,
          "css_class": "dnd-module",
          "headline_lh": "normal",
          "headline_size": 32,
          "items": [
           {
            "answer": "We support dropshipping arrangements for established programs. Dropshipping means we ship branded individual orders directly to your end customers as you sell them. This avoids the upfront inventory commitment of traditional private label but typically costs more per unit. Talk to us about your specific dropshipping needs.",
            "question": "Do you actually offer dropshipping or is this for finished-goods buyers only?"
           },
           {
            "answer": "Per-unit costs are higher with dropshipping because we don't get the production efficiencies of large batch runs. Setup costs are lower because you don't commit to large inventory orders. The math typically favors traditional inventory once you're shipping 50+ units per month consistently.",
            "question": "What are the cost differences between dropshipping and traditional inventory?"
           },
           {
            "answer": "Same as traditional private label. Your brand on the label, your colors and design. The packaging looks identical to inventory-fulfilled product. Every order ships under your brand and packaging.",
            "question": "How does branding work on dropshipped supplements?"
           },
           {
            "answer": "Most dropshipped orders ship within 2-3 business days of receipt. We use standard shipping carriers (USPS, UPS, FedEx) and pass the cost through. Faster shipping is available at additional cost for time-sensitive promotions.",
            "question": "What's the typical fulfillment time for dropshipped orders?"
           },
           {
            "answer": "Limited. International dropshipping involves customs declarations, varying supplement regulations, and longer shipping times. We can handle some international destinations but recommend domestic dropshipping or traditional inventory + international 3PL for serious international plays.",
            "question": "Can I dropship internationally?"
           }
          ],
